			"notes": "# 0.2.19\n\n## Pawn Shop\n\nYou can now craft a Pawn Shop using a Silver Coin, Planks, and a Mud Brick Slab. \nThis block allows you to buy items from other players. \nIt works very similarly to the shop, except that you have to fill its built-in purse with coins.\n\n## Other Changes\n\n- Backported improved mob drop config system from 0.3.2\n- Make Piggy Banks dyeable, you now have 16 more variants for it!\n- Improved format of `/numismatic balance` command\n- Allow using `/numismatic balance` without operator status to check your own balance\n- Disable hard crash of rare edge case if you have an invalid money bag\n- Added russian translations (#183, thanks AShu7SPb!)"
		},
